; ---------------------------------------------------------------
;  DmaWramStagingUpload  --  GP-DMA into WRAM (NOT HDMA, NOT VRAM)
;    Copies $80 bytes/iteration from src ($2A:$2C) into WRAM bank
;    $7E via the WRAM data port: sets WMADDL/H ($2181/$2183), points
;    the B-bus at $2180 WMDATA (BBAD7=$80, DMAP7=$00), then fires
;    GP-DMA via MDMAEN ($420B=$80). Trace destinations are
;    $7E4180/$7E4380/.. in $0200 strides (base = $4000+(val<<5)),
;    so the '$7E4300 staging buffer' premise is approximate -- the
;    base is dynamic, not a fixed $4300. The 'VMADD/$2181' reading
;    is WRONG: $2181 is WMADDL, not VMADDL ($2116).
